{%- style -%}
  #cora-warranty-{{ section.id }} {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color }};
    padding:  20px;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cora-policy-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 0;
     border-radius: 8px;
  }

  /* TYPOGRAPHY */
  .cora-policy-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-align: justify;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cora-policy-intro {
    text-align: justify;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .cora-policy-heading {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color:rgb(30, 30, 30); /* Imperial Blue */
    margin-top: 35px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cora-policy-subheading {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #000;
  }

  .cora-policy-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  .cora-policy-list {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .cora-policy-list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cora-highlight {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #000;
  }

  .cora-link {
    color: #2f5496;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .cora-policy-container {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .cora-policy-title {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section id="cora-warranty-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="cora-policy-container">
    
    {% comment %} <h1 class="cora-policy-title">Imperial Knots – Rug Warranty</h1> {% endcomment %}
    <p class="cora-policy-intro">
      We are committed to the quality and craftsmanship of our rugs. All Imperial Knots rugs include a 
      <span class="cora-highlight">6-month warranty</span> from the date of delivery against 
      <span class="cora-highlight">manufacturing defects</span>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">What’s Covered</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">This warranty covers defects in:</p>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Weaving or construction</li>
      <li>Materials or workmanship</li>
      <li>Issues that impact the rug’s structure, durability, or appearance</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">The warranty applies only to the <span class="cora-highlight">original purchaser</span> and is <span class="cora-highlight">non-transferable</span>.</p>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">What’s Not Covered (Exclusions)</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">This warranty does <span class="cora-highlight">not</span> cover damage or changes that occur as part of normal use or natural characteristics of handcrafted rugs.</p>

    <div class="cora-policy-subheading">Normal Characteristics (Not Defects):</div>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Natural fiber slubs or texture variation</li>
      <li>Minor weaving variances</li>
      <li>Loose yarn ends (“sprouting”)</li>
      <li>Initial shedding</li>
      <li>Light packaging odour</li>
      <li>Temporary fold/crease marks</li>
      <li>Size variation up to <span class="cora-highlight">±3%</span></li>
      <li>Colour variation due to natural dye lots</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cora-policy-subheading">Wear & Use Over Time:</div>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Normal wear and tear</li>
      <li>Pile crushing or flattening</li>
      <li>Shading, watermarking, or texture change</li>
      <li>Fringe variations</li>
      <li>Sunlight/UV colour fading</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cora-policy-subheading">Damage from Use or Environment:</div>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Stains and spills</li>
      <li>Pet-related damage</li>
      <li>Snags, pulls, burns</li>
      <li>Moth/insect damage</li>
      <li>Mold/mildew</li>
      <li>Water/chemical exposure</li>
      <li>Improper or harsh cleaning methods</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cora-policy-subheading">Improper Placement or Handling:</div>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Use <span class="cora-highlight">without a rug pad</span> on hard floors</li>
      <li>Cutting, trimming, or altering the rug</li>
      <li>Use in <span class="cora-highlight">commercial/high-traffic</span> settings if the rug is rated for residential use</li>
      <li>Damage from heavy furniture without protective pads/casters</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cora-policy-subheading">Third-Party or Storage Damage:</div>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Repairs or cleaning by non-approved providers</li>
      <li>Damage that occurs during storage after delivery</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cora-policy-subheading">Transit Damage:</div>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Must be reported <span class="cora-highlight">within 48 hours of delivery</span>; claims outside this window are not covered.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">How to Report a Concern</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">If you believe your rug has a manufacturing defect:</p>
    <ol class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>Email <a href="mailto:customercare@imperialknots.com" class="cora-link">customercare@imperialknots.com</a> or call <span class="cora-highlight">+91-95591-40222</span></li>
      <li>Provide your <span class="cora-highlight">order number</span></li>
      <li>Share:
        <ul style="margin-top: 5px;">
          <li>At least 3-4 <span class="cora-highlight">clear photos</span> showing the rug and the concern</li>
          <li>A short <span class="cora-highlight">video</span> if the issue is structural or movement-related</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">What Happens Next</h2>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>We review the issue and may request further details or schedule an inspection.</li>
      <li>If the defect is covered, we will <span class="cora-highlight">repair, replace, or refund</span> the rug based on what we determine is the most suitable solution.</li>
      <li>If a replacement is issued, the warranty continues from the <span class="cora-highlight">original delivery date</span>, not renewed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">Shipping for Inspection</h2>
    <ul class="cora-policy-list">
      <li>The customer initially covers shipping for return evaluation.</li>
      <li>If a manufacturing defect is confirmed, <span class="cora-highlight">we will reimburse or arrange pickup</span>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="cora-policy-heading">Policy Updates</h2>
    <p class="cora-policy-text">Imperial Knots may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always be available through our customer support team or on our website.</p>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Warranty Policy Doc",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "bg_color",
      "label": "Background Color",
      "default": "#f4f4f4"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Warranty Policy Doc"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}